{
  "schema-note": "Extracted from workflow-contract.json (v1.12.0). This is the startup routing slice: bdd-orchestrator reads THIS file at complexity-assessment, not the whole contract. On resume it reads neither — runtime-metadata.profile already holds the answer.",
  "note": "啟動時讀取。決定本 run 走哪一個 profile。判定準則與各 profile 詳細程序見 runbook-ref；本區塊只提供路由所需的最小事實。",
  "runbook-ref": ".codex/bdd-workflow/runbooks/complexity-routing.md",
